Time passes...
Floyd produces a crayon from one of his compartments and scrawls his name on the wall.

You collapse from extreme thirst and hunger.

    ****  You have died  ****

Your score would be 27 (out of 80 points). It is Day 2 of your adventure. Current Galactic Standard Time (adjusted to your local day-cycle) is TIME.
This score gives you the rank of Ensign First Class.

Oh, well. According to the Treaty of Gishen IV, signed in TIME GY, all adventure game players must be given another chance after dying. In the interests of interstellar peace...

